<title>POLAND: Exbud signs PLN 21 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Exbud signs PLN 21 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction company Exbud SA signed a 21 million zloty contract with the Polfa pharmaceutical company in the town of Grodzisk Mazowiecki to build a drug production department, Exbud said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the construction would start this month and end in April 1998.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
